            "review_title": "Review at Kohaku Sashimi & Yakiniku",
            "review_text": "Adora Dao\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nBest location for both Yakiniku and fresh Sashimi\nNov 2023 • Friends\nOne of the Yakiniku & Sashimi location that i love, top 5 in my favorite-spot-list. Food is good and not pricey. I would recommend to try the Yakiniku, sashimi set, \"Don\" - salmon rice in Japanese style, and hot soup. They make amazing combo.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 20, 2023\nCông ty TNHH S.O.L\nMr. / Mrs. Adoradao2299 ,\n\nThank you very much for your feedback at Kohaku Sashimi & Yakiniku, Landmark 81\nWe truly appreciate and care about the experience you had at our restaurant.\nYour compliments and love for the restaurant's services and dishes are a great motivation for Kohaku to continue trying harder to bring diners the best quality service.\n\nWe really appreciate your reviews and wish you a nice day.\nS.O.L Team\nRead more\nWritten December 28, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
